<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea April precious metals import prices down.</title>
<headline>S.Korea April precious metals import prices down.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's precious metals import prices fell in April from the previous month due to the fall in world market prices, the Association of Foreign Trading Agents of Korea (AFTAK) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Import prices of precious metals were as follows:</p>
<p>(price per tonne on CIF)</p>
<p> METAL		    Apr	 Mar</p>
<p> Gold (gram)	  $11.21    $11.47</p>
<p> Silver (Kg)	 $157.65   $171.54</p>
<p> Platinum (t/oz)   $377.26   $388.46</p>
<p> Palladium (t/oz)  $123.25   $126.79</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
